# prompt_control_lab prompt guard

Before acting on a broad, vague, risky, or expensive prompt, run:

```bash
pcl guard --prompt "<paste prompt here>" --profile coding --token-mode balanced --policy examples/guard.policy.yaml
```

For wrappers:

```bash
echo "<paste prompt here>" | pcl guard --stdin --profile coding --policy examples/guard.policy.yaml --json
```

If `pcl guard` returns `action=block`, do not continue until the prompt is revised.
